{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.40.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd2d8f21ed65fa7dce75d1539dec9166","RawContent":"Absolutely. All resorts have onsite wedding coordinators who can answer questions and provide wedding package info. A TA can help put you in touch with the WC. \n\n\nSent from my Nexus 5 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1910598,"PostDate":1454792093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Absolutely. All resorts have onsite wedding coordinators who can answer questions and provide wedding package info. A TA can help put you in touch with the WC. <br><br>\nSent from my Nexus 5 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278639480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.172.236.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0fc402d55038762576cde2363a1b32f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to this great forum, here you\u00b4ll find the information you are looking for. Congratulations on your wedding!!\n&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" title=\"Smile03\" alt=\"smile03.gif\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Gonzalo Verdeja&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910791,"PostDate":1455217028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to this great forum, here you\u00b4ll find the information you are looking for. Congratulations on your wedding!!<br><span><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" title=\"Smile03\" alt=\"smile03.gif\"><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Gonzalo Verdeja<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258568901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.6.245","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79898,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76b0674953cbf3b0abab3c1645f7e264","RawContent":"Congratulations you have heard a lot of good advice. But for us deciding on wedding at home in Texas or a nice beach. Since we both love the beach so the beach it is. It means more to us being on an island with friends and family. And going through a travel agent who deals with destations wedding has been a lot of help.","Attachments":[],"Id":1910801,"PostDate":1455270623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 Congratulations you have heard a lot of good advice. But for us deciding on wedding at home in Texas or a nice beach. Since we both love the beach so the beach it is. It means more to us being on an island with friends and family. And going through a travel agent who deals with destations wedding has been a lot of help.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440276410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
