ntent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Seahagamy&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I recently order my wedding dress from bridalonlinestore and is FANTASTIC. I lost my first dress to a house fire so I had to get it shipped ASAP and they came through for me.....I even like it way better than my first dress! AND I live in Canada. They also gave me a free matching hand bag and a shawl that was a complete surprise because it didn&#039;t say it was included. AWESOME experience.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n My dress came from the USA and it arrived in 2.5 weeks.","Attachments":[],"Id":540305,"PostDate":1230046363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Seahagamy<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I recently order my wedding dress from bridalonlinestore and is FANTASTIC. I lost my first dress to a house fire so I had to get it shipped ASAP and they came through for me.....I even like it way better than my first dress! AND I live in Canada. They also gave me a free matching hand bag and a shawl that was a complete surprise because it didn't say it was included. AWESOME experience.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> My dress came from the USA and it arrived in 2.5 weeks.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;60\/st\/20090115\/e\/Our+Wedding+%21%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/14d8\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...14d8\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"seahagamy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1205887937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208850.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":72,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Seahagamy","Id":208850,"Name":"Seahagamy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":64,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
