        Here you go!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.my-wedding-reception-planning.com\/can-wwwinweddingdresscom-be-trusted-comments.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Comments for Can www.inweddingdress.com be trusted?<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"worsfoldwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276296220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229097.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hermosahoops","Id":229097,"Name":"hermosahoops","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a4a6f7c9596063ee2b500465d744a80","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]magirl[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Can you tell me where these reviews are? There is a dress I like too![\/quote] \n Also here: [url=\"http:\/\/bridalbudget.wordpress.com\/\"]http:\/\/bridalbudget.wordpress.com\/[\/url] \n \n There have several reviews with pictures attached... I have been checking it for a few months cause there is a dress I like too...","Attachments":[],"Id":1234300,"PostDate":1280272141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>magirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid ;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Can you tell me where these reviews are? There is a dress I like too!<\/blockquote> <p> Also here: <a href='http:\/\/bridalbudget.wordpress.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bridalbudget.wordpress.com\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There have several reviews with pictures attached... I have been checking it for a few months cause there is a dress I like too...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ramona.hebrew@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1280271134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230755.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rosalind","Id":230755,"Name":"Rosalind","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f327b7b961c297005d59b975445a906b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1240045,"PostDate":1280739318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmedley02@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1279079227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230219.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bediva33","Id":230219,"Name":"bediva33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d9d018573ae8f14e5cab58a22d39d5c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I can tell you who NOT to deal with! &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;DiscoutDress.com &amp;nbsp; is a horrible place to deal with. &amp;nbsp;I ordered a dress, giving them the size I normally wear here in the US, with additional information that they requested. &amp;nbsp;When the dress arrived, I couldn&#039;t even fit into it. &amp;nbsp;When I wrote to them about returning the dress and getting a refund, they requested I lay the dress on the floor and take pictures of a measuring tape showing the wrong measurements. &amp;nbsp;I did that. &amp;nbsp;They requested MORE pictures. &amp;nbsp;I did that. &amp;nbsp;They then said they did NOT make a mistake and they would credit me $30. &amp;nbsp;They lie and cheat and should be ashamed of themselves! &amp;nbsp;DON&#039;T USE THESE PEOPLE!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1611054,"PostDate":1335259803,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I can tell you who NOT to deal with! \u00a0 \u00a0DiscoutDress.com \u00a0 is a horrible place to deal with. \u00a0I ordered a dress, giving them the size I normally wear here in the US, with additional information that they requested. \u00a0When the dress arrived, I couldn't even fit into it. \u00a0When I wrote to them about returning the dress and getting a refund, they requested I lay the dress on the floor and take pictures of a measuring tape showing the wrong measurements. \u00a0I did that. \u00a0They requested MORE pictures. \u00a0I did that. \u00a0They then said they did NOT make a mistake and they would credit me $30. \u00a0They lie and cheat and should be ashamed of themselves! \u00a0DON'T USE THESE PEOPLE!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"LindaAIsaacsJr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1335259610,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254446.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LindaAIsaacsJr","Id":254446,"Name":"LindaAIsaacsJr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"416a8df86ce9fb6e06ab64deaa1d2d3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would like to tell you of a company that you should NOT order from. &amp;nbsp; www.discountdress.com &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;They lie and cheat you of your money. &amp;nbsp;The quality is way below what it should be. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I ordered a dress, giving them the normal size I take here in America. &amp;nbsp;They asked me for more information and I gave it to them. &amp;nbsp;When the dress came, I couldn&#039;t fit into it!! &amp;nbsp;I wanted to return the dress and get a refund. &amp;nbsp;They requested I lay the dress on the floor and take pictures, using a measuring tape, of how small the dress was........to see if they had in fact made a mistake. &amp;nbsp;I did that. &amp;nbsp;They asked for MORE pictures and I did THAT. &amp;nbsp;They then said that they did not make a mistake and that they would send me a $30 refund on the $150 dress I bought! &amp;nbsp;I protested and they upped it to $50. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do NOT use this company!!! There are American companies out there that SHOULD be used before using one from China.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Linda Isaacs&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1611065,"PostDate":1335260274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would like to tell you of a company that you should NOT order from. \u00a0 www.discountdress.com \u00a0 \u00a0They lie and cheat you of your money. \u00a0The quality is way below what it should be. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I ordered a dress, giving them the normal size I take here in America. \u00a0They asked me for more information and I gave it to them. \u00a0When the dress came, I couldn't fit into it!! \u00a0I wanted to return the dress and get a refund. \u00a0They requested I lay the dress on the floor and take pictures, using a measuring tape, of how small the dress was........to see if they had in fact made a mistake. \u00a0I did that. \u00a0They asked for MORE pictures and I did THAT. \u00a0They then said that they did not make a mistake and that they would send me a $30 refund on the $150 dress I bought! \u00a0I protested and they upped it to $50. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do NOT use this company!!! There are American companies out there that SHOULD be used before using one from China.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Linda Isaacs<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"LindaAIsaacsJr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1335259610,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254446.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LindaAIsaacsJr","Id":254446,"Name":"LindaAIsaacsJr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.161.199","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9540cee5b6eec79cd480c79dafea3003","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;nice info...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;maybe if you need a nice suit or dress for your child... you can buy at wallao...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thats many coupon discount..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905919,"PostDate":1444025048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>nice info...<\/p>\n<p>maybe if you need a nice suit or dress for your child... you can buy at wallao...<\/p>\n<p>thats many coupon discount..<\/p>\n<p>good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430646822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.124.7.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e10e1a99b7b4a207d1cb1a769b7f0040","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i&#039;m not sure about wedding dress..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thats i know is wallao, a website for wedding accesories, ring bearer and flower girl costume...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;have a discount around 10%&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906480,"PostDate":1445159037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i'm not sure about wedding dress..<\/p>\n<p>thats i know is wallao, a website for wedding accesories, ring bearer and flower girl costume...<\/p>\n<p>have a discount around 10%<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430646822,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":64,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
