{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38a70dab2f08eb7570ad62ac003c889d","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;islandbride317&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Maybe you could call around to a few dry cleaners and ask them for their expert opinions on how well satin cleans-up after submersion in water? That might be helpful in deciding what you want to do...\n \n And there is always the option of finding a dirt-cheap dress just for the TTD session. I just got a dress on ebay for $75, making me another 3 DRESS BRIDE (I also have a regular gown for the ceremony, and a shorter dress for the reception)! I thought it was worth it to avoid any drama over trashing my real dress!\n \n Good luck!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;HAHAHA! Well since I am a member of the 4 dress (and a reception dress) club my self thats not really an option &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/censored.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Censored\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; I kinda already went that rout and now am trying to sell 3 so I don&#039;t totally ruin our wedding budget!\n \n Also my FI said if I bought one more we weren&#039;t going to have a wedding (in a J\/K manner of course) I could probably squeeze 1 more in but who wants to push it&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; &amp;lt;- that is what I need apparently!\n \n But Yes I agree thats a very good Idea","Attachments":[],"Id":666830,"PostDate":1240578539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>islandbride317<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Maybe you could call around to a few dry cleaners and ask them for their expert opinions on how well satin cleans-up after submersion in water? That might be helpful in deciding what you want to do...<br \/> <br \/> And there is always the option of finding a dirt-cheap dress just for the TTD session. I just got a dress on ebay for $75, making me another 3 DRESS BRIDE (I also have a regular gown for the ceremony, and a shorter dress for the reception)! I thought it was worth it to avoid any drama over trashing my real dress!<br \/> <br \/> Good luck!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>HAHAHA! Well since I am a member of the 4 dress (and a reception dress) club my self thats not really an option <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/censored.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Censored\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> I kinda already went that rout and now am trying to sell 3 so I don't totally ruin our wedding budget!<br \/> <br \/> Also my FI said if I bought one more we weren't going to have a wedding (in a J\/K manner of course) I could probably squeeze 1 more in but who wants to push it<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <- that is what I need apparently!<br \/> <br \/> But Yes I agree thats a very good Idea\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Jillandtimswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1235353260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215165.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Adlergray","Id":215165,"Name":"Adlergray","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"504f105b62f98db1365493a1de5d428a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KJT1985&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I don&#039;t know but I was told by one dress sales-lady to not get taffeta or satin anywhere near water. I guess it leaves &amp;quot;stains&amp;quot; or water marks - but does it matter if the WHOLE dress gets wet?! and does it come out with cleaning is an even better question...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I bought a secondhand Maggie, satin with chiffon overlay. It hadn&#039;t been drycleaned so there was dirt around the bottom &amp;amp; train and some bronzer around the inside bodice that needed to be removed. I didn&#039;t trust that a drycleaning would get it all out so I cleaned it myself. \n \n I just used arm &amp;amp; hammer laundry detergent and a soft eyebrow brush to clean spot clean and rinse. Then I filled the tub with cool water and a bit of detergent and dunked the whole dress in, swished it around then rinsed a couple times, squeezed the excess water out. Let it dry flat on some towels to get more water out, so it wasn&#039;t too heavy. Then finally hung it to dry in the basement for a day and it looks better than new and smells fresh :) and... no water marks.\n \n Not sure I&#039;d try this with lace or silk though.","Attachments":[],"Id":667062,"PostDate":1240585231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KJT1985<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I don't know but I was told by one dress sales-lady to not get taffeta or satin anywhere near water. I guess it leaves \"stains\" or water marks - but does it matter if the WHOLE dress gets wet?! and does it come out with cleaning is an even better question...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I bought a secondhand Maggie, satin with chiffon overlay. It hadn't been drycleaned so there was dirt around the bottom & train and some bronzer around the inside bodice that needed to be removed. I didn't trust that a drycleaning would get it all out so I cleaned it myself. <br \/> <br \/> I just used arm & hammer laundry detergent and a soft eyebrow brush to clean spot clean and rinse. Then I filled the tub with cool water and a bit of detergent and dunked the whole dress in, swished it around then rinsed a couple times, squeezed the excess water out. Let it dry flat on some towels to get more water out, so it wasn't too heavy. Then finally hung it to dry in the basement for a day and it looks better than new and smells fresh <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> and... no water marks.<br \/> <br \/> Not sure I'd try this with lace or silk though.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_madalene@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235409550,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215182.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beach2009","Id":215182,"Name":"beach2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a9f02abbad72eb603cd7366f9a06aa1","RawContent":"I am a member of the 4 dress bride club, so I guess which ever I trash it won&#039;t really matter...but I hear you on not wanting to completely ruin the ceremony dress!\n \n I bought a second dress for the TTD, its chiffon, so I thought it would look really pretty. However, as far as the two weeks thing goes, I was planning on asking one of my BMs to bring my ceremony dress back with her instead of hauling it to our honeymoon. \n \n Maybe if there&#039;s someone you trust to bring your dress back and take it to the cleaners, it wouldn&#039;t need to sit around for two weeks!\n \n I would be careful with taffeta dresses. My bridal consultant told me to even make sure it&#039;s steamed inside out or it could stain. I would call a dry cleaner or go and ask at one to see what they think. I&#039;m sure any larger dry cleaner would have some experience with taffeta or silk dresses.","Attachments":[],"Id":668653,"PostDate":1240713206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am a member of the 4 dress bride club, so I guess which ever I trash it won't really matter...but I hear you on not wanting to completely ruin the ceremony dress!<br \/> <br \/> I bought a second dress for the TTD, its chiffon, so I thought it would look really pretty. However, as far as the two weeks thing goes, I was planning on asking one of my BMs to bring my ceremony dress back with her instead of hauling it to our honeymoon. <br \/> <br \/> Maybe if there's someone you trust to bring your dress back and take it to the cleaners, it wouldn't need to sit around for two weeks!<br \/> <br \/> I would be careful with taffeta dresses. My bridal consultant told me to even make sure it's steamed inside out or it could stain. I would call a dry cleaner or go and ask at one to see what they think. I'm sure any larger dry cleaner would have some experience with taffeta or silk dresses.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;130\/st\/20090718\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/2716\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...2716\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i634.photobucket.com\/albums\/uu61\/ninacaliguiri\/EngagementSiggyPic-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i634.photobucket.com\/albums\/u...SiggyPic-2.jpg<\/a><br><span>Bride, Groom, and 26 Guests booked! We're done!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ninacaliguiri@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1224823575,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212385.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nibsmom","Id":212385,"Name":"nibsmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9c97f0fce7674ff34427e526fcab387","RawContent":"I&#039;m hoping that the wonderful crew on this forum can help me out with a brainstorming endeavor. My photographer has never been to Jamaica and I was only there for 3 days in January. We are trying to come up with ideas of where we can do a TTD session the morning after our wedding (a Saturday morning). I know that I have seen posts mentioning the resort itself and Dunn&#039;s River. I&#039;m trying to think of other places that my photographer could consider\/scout. She is coming down a couple days in advance so she can scout out the resort for the wedding photos as well as ideas for the TTD. Does anyone have any ideas of locations off-resort near Montego Bay that might make good locations.","Attachments":[],"Id":673876,"PostDate":1241044259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm hoping that the wonderful crew on this forum can help me out with a brainstorming endeavor. My photographer has never been to Jamaica and I was only there for 3 days in January. We are trying to come up with ideas of where we can do a TTD session the morning after our wedding (a Saturday morning). I know that I have seen posts mentioning the resort itself and Dunn's River. I'm trying to think of other places that my photographer could consider\/scout. She is coming down a couple days in advance so she can scout out the resort for the wedding photos as well as ideas for the TTD. Does anyone have any ideas of locations off-resort near Montego Bay that might make good locations.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Don't walk behind me; I may not lead. Don't walk in front of me; I may not follow. Just walk beside me and be my friend. ~ Albert Camas<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"threetsloth@verizon.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1234047824,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214715.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jamaica0619","Id":214715,"Name":"Jamaica0619","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd047d357381e2faa421bc5be501cb6d","RawContent":"I am having the same issues, but I am looking for a place in Ocho Rios, Jamaica. I hear there are some great local beaches, and Coyaba Gardens, but I am still up in the air. My photographer won&#039;t have time to scout the area, as they arriving the day before the wedding and leaving early Sunday..","Attachments":[],"Id":674103,"PostDate":1241055811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am having the same issues, but I am looking for a place in Ocho Rios, Jamaica. I hear there are some great local beaches, and Coyaba Gardens, but I am still up in the air. My photographer won't have time to scout the area, as they arriving the day before the wedding and leaving early Sunday..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Soon To Be: Mrs. Ham<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"glatricejohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1236599392,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215618.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"latricej919","Id":215618,"Name":"latricej919","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df1de648a581ecc7046551ccb7f22e5a","RawContent":"Hi, Well I have decided to TTD and we are going to Dunns River to do this. Just a question to all you ladies that have done this. Did you travel in your dress or did you take it with you and change there ? did you do this the day of your wedding or the day after ?","Attachments":[],"Id":692323,"PostDate":1242384629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, Well I have decided to TTD and we are going to Dunns River to do this. Just a question to all you ladies that have done this. Did you travel in your dress or did you take it with you and change there ? did you do this the day of your wedding or the day after ?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10747;6\/st\/20090623\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/6\/k\/657d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...657d\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"susan.blurton@ntlworld.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1219143299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211265.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blurt","Id":211265,"Name":"blurt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57735bca5d5c78e35f37ce25a343c047","RawContent":"I am going to a TTD also but right at the resort. I am doing it one or two days after the wedding, and at sun rise, because then there will not be so many people around to get &amp;quot;in&amp;quot; the pictures.","Attachments":[],"Id":692390,"PostDate":1242388744,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am going to a TTD also but right at the resort. I am doing it one or two days after the wedding, and at sun rise, because then there will not be so many people around to get \"in\" the pictures.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10301;6\/st\/20091116\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/eff6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...eff6\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i731.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww311\/Boobear-Tomcat\/033_TTD-Currie.jpg\">http:\/\/i731.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...TTD-Currie.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"pcurrie@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1235342736,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215157.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"itsfinallyhere","Id":215157,"Name":"itsfinallyhere","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9ccff6e78e1a9254900dd0d1e631dac","RawContent":"I did mine at Mayfielf Falls, we stayed in Negril the second week. i traveled with it on, we stoped at different places along the way (it is a 1hr drive there). But Dunns is not that far from ROR but you can always stop if the photographer is traveling with you and you want to. I took a change of cloths so I could change after.","Attachments":[],"Id":692431,"PostDate":1242391310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did mine at Mayfielf Falls, we stayed in Negril the second week. i traveled with it on, we stoped at different places along the way (it is a 1hr drive there). But Dunns is not that far from ROR but you can always stop if the photographer is traveling with you and you want to. I took a change of cloths so I could change after.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Christina<\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"christinarovensky@live.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1226018562,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212574.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tina82","Id":212574,"Name":"tina82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43e395b9b86a1777cbb83601e7cf593a","RawContent":"We did ours at the resort - the day after the wedding. It was great, at 11:00 on our first day as Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs.... we trashed the dress..\n \n I say wear your dress to the falls... I&#039;d love any excuse to put mine back on!\n \n :)\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i267.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii305\/iemba\/Pictures%20for%20Review\/52.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":692432,"PostDate":1242391362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We did ours at the resort - the day after the wedding. It was great, at 11:00 on our first day as Mr. & Mrs.... we trashed the dress..<br \/> <br \/> I say wear your dress to the falls... I'd love any excuse to put mine back on!<br \/> <br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i267.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii305\/iemba\/Pictures%20for%20Review\/52.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Barcelo Marina Palace, Varadero Cuba<\/span><br><i><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/chadandamy2009\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/chadandamy2009<\/a><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i267.photobucket.com\/albums\/ii305\/iemba\/Picture1.jpg\">http:\/\/i267.photobucket.com\/albums\/i...a\/Picture1.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t35515\">Amarillis' Planning Thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t37538\">Mrs. Amarillis' Non-Pro Pics<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t39915\">Mrs. Amarillis' Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t41563\">Mrs. Amarillis' Pro Pics, Photobook and Slideshow<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEQg-O6k0010MDUwNDBsfDkxODk2c3xDdWJhIHdoZXJlIG91ciBmb3JldmVyIGJlZ2FuLi4u.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEQg-O6k00...JlZ2F...<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.baby-gaga.com\/p\/dev108prs__.png\"><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"amysonnenburg@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.91.140.12","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1210612140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209358.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amarillis","Id":209358,"Name":"Amarillis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":35087,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cf9b21a6450971c23d96412de8a4430","RawContent":"I did the TTD at Dunns. After starting it in the Ocean that same morning. We did the beach ones at 5:30 am and Dunns didn&#039;t open until 8. By 7:40 when we were getting in a cab my dress was almost dry (but we brought a towel and a plastic bag just in case I was wet.) But I dried out pretty good. I even wore the dress home from Dunns without soaking everything. \n \n When we got to Dunns for 8am there was not anyone there. when we were leaving there were tons of people just starting to walk down to the falls. I got some looks but it was fine!","Attachments":[],"Id":699655,"PostDate":1242996762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I did the TTD at Dunns. After starting it in the Ocean that same morning. We did the beach ones at 5:30 am and Dunns didn't open until 8. By 7:40 when we were getting in a cab my dress was almost dry (but we brought a towel and a plastic bag just in case I was wet.) But I dried out pretty good. I even wore the dress home from Dunns without soaking everything. <br \/> <br \/> When we got to Dunns for 8am there was not anyone there. when we were leaving there were tons of people just starting to walk down to the falls. I got some looks but it was fine!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.justinandsharon.com\">www.justinandsharon.com<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i305.photobucket.com\/albums\/nn230\/novascotiacaper\/wedding%20photos\/JAM_9016-2-2.jpg\">http:\/\/i305.photobucket.com\/albums\/n...M_9016-2-2.jpg<\/a><br><br><span>Riu Ocho Rios, JamaicaApril 21, 2009<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sharon@dal.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1200314384,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208227.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nscaper","Id":208227,"Name":"nscaper","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":442,"TotalPages":45,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":440},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
